From: mirx developers
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Keep a new class findable as soon as the server knows it.

NtUserRegisterClassExWOW creates the class on the server and only later,
after taking user_lock, adds it to the process's class_list, which is
where NtUserGetClassInfoEx (and so CreateWindowEx) looks classes up.

Classes such as comctl32's are registered lazily on first use:
CreateWindowEx calls get_class_version, which calls the DLL's
RegisterClassNameW, and then looks the class up.  When two threads
create the first window of such a class at once, the second thread's
RegisterClass fails with ERROR_CLASS_ALREADY_EXISTS while the first is
between the server call and the class_list insertion; its lookup then
misses, and CreateWindowEx fails with ERROR_CLASS_DOES_NOT_EXIST.

Take user_lock before the create_class request and hold it until the
class is in class_list, so that no thread can find that the class
exists on the server and then miss it in class_list.
The small icon is copied before taking the lock, since CopyImage may
call back into user mode; it is destroyed again if registration fails.

Seen with N threads that each create the first window of the same
comctl32 class at once (e.g. msctls_statusbar32, SysTreeView32): most
runs had at least one CreateWindowEx fail with error 1411.

---
--- a/dlls/win32u/class.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/class.c
@@ -548,6 +548,17 @@
 
     class->local      = !is_builtin && !(wc->style & CS_GLOBALCLASS);
 
+    /* Other non-null values must be set by caller */
+    if (wc->hIcon && !wc->hIconSm)
+        sm_icon = CopyImage( wc->hIcon, IMAGE_ICON,
+                             get_system_metrics( SM_CXSMICON ),
+                             get_system_metrics( SM_CYSMICON ),
+                             LR_COPYFROMRESOURCE );
+
+    /* Hold the lock from creating the server class until it is in class_list:
+     * a thread that fails to register the class because it already exists
+     * must then be able to find it. */
+    user_lock();
     SERVER_START_REQ( create_class )
     {
         req->local      = class->local;
@@ -565,6 +576,8 @@
     SERVER_END_REQ;
     if (!ret)
     {
+        user_unlock();
+        NtUserDestroyCursor( sm_icon, 0 );
         free( class );
         return 0;
     }
@@ -579,18 +592,12 @@
             wine_server_call( req );
         }
         SERVER_END_REQ;
+        user_unlock();
+        NtUserDestroyCursor( sm_icon, 0 );
         free( class );
         return 0;
     }
 
-    /* Other non-null values must be set by caller */
-    if (wc->hIcon && !wc->hIconSm)
-        sm_icon = CopyImage( wc->hIcon, IMAGE_ICON,
-                             get_system_metrics( SM_CXSMICON ),
-                             get_system_metrics( SM_CYSMICON ),
-                             LR_COPYFROMRESOURCE );
-
-    user_lock();
     if (class->local) list_add_head( &class_list, &class->entry );
     else list_add_tail( &class_list, &class->entry );
 
